==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|twerc}}, from {{inh|de|goh|twerc}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*dwerg}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*dwergaz}}.

The development Middle High German ''tw-'' > modern German ''zw-'' is regular. Compare {{cog|nl|dwerg}}, {{cog|en|dwarf}}, {{cog|nds|Dwarg}}, {{cog|da|dværg}}.

